      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.31,
      "end_seconds": 197.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.82,
      "end_seconds": 201.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "nothing unusual, um, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.51,
      "end_seconds": 205.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "before we go further any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.78,
      "end_seconds": 209.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.14,
      "end_seconds": 217.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.28,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions? I ask cos it helps me narrow things down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.71,
      "end_seconds": 226.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "uh I've had eczema for nearly five years now. I've had anxiety yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.72,
      "end_seconds": 229.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.42,
      "end_seconds": 242.4,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "sorry, what was I saying, yes, I had a a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.12,
      "end_seconds": 253.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.03,
      "end_seconds": 259.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.02,
      "end_seconds": 264.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "right, are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.94,
      "end_seconds": 269.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.42,
      "end_seconds": 284.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.72,
      "end_seconds": 297.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed. A reliever inhaler i take it 100 micrograms, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.53,
      "end_seconds": 307.75,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "hm, okay let me tell you where I've got to i don't have a clear answer today: occupational asthma is possible, and so is COPD"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.4,
      "end_seconds": 312.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Oh I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.51,
      "end_seconds": 348.54,
      "duration_seconds": 34.03,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like occupational asthma, but I'd like to confirm. I'm going to order serial peak flow readings, for work-related wheeze. I'll request spirometry, it'll help with wheeze. I'll start you on beclometasone inhaler, 200 micrograms, twice a day, long term. That should help with asthma. Record peak flows at work and at home for four weeks. Let's plan a check in four weeks. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.62,
      "end_seconds": 353.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "I think I understand everything thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.62,
      "end_seconds": 355.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
  ]
